    65	- `disk=nvme` selects `hosts/profiles/btrfs/<desktop|server>.env` for the Btrfs/XFS bare-metal baseline. This class also covers fixed non-removable SATA-style bare-metal hosts when no VM or eMMC class is detected.
    66	- `disk=vm` selects `hosts/profiles/vm/<desktop|server>.env`.
